@startuml
title Friend request states

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #DC2626
}

[*] --> PENDING : Alice sends a request to Boris

state "PENDING\nRequest is waiting for a decision" as PENDING
state "ACCEPTED\nRequest is accepted" as ACCEPTED
state "REJECTED\nRequest is rejected" as REJECTED

note right of PENDING
  The system creates a friend request.
  Alice starts following Boris.
  Friendship is not created yet.
end note

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : Boris accepts the request
PENDING --> REJECTED : Boris rejects the request

note right of ACCEPTED
  The system creates mutual friendship.
  Boris is added to Alice's friends list.
  Alice is added to Boris's friends list.
  Boris starts following Alice.
end note

note right of REJECTED
  Friendship is not created.
  Alice remains a follower of Boris.
end note

note bottom
  Process invariants
  --
  A user cannot send a friend request to themselves.
  Two active requests in the same direction cannot exist.
  Friendship cannot exist only for one side.
  Accepting a request must create friendship and reverse following atomically.
  Rejecting a request does not cancel the sender's following relation.
  Repeating a command must not create duplicate relations.
end note

ACCEPTED --> [*] : process completed successfully
REJECTED --> [*] : process completed with rejection
@enduml
